========================================================================================
SUPPORT-FLOOR SEQUENCE
========================================================================================
THM-538 is an exact-support statement for the signed Fourier expansion over the relation lattice.  It says all genuine support <=5 relation terms vanish, and the first live layer is support 6.
Guardrail: do not test this by plugging zero coordinates into the raw ambient K function; that includes lower-dimensional boundary/main pieces. The proof object is the exact-support coefficient after the signed inclusion-exclusion projection.
